Wikipedia content

The MIT License above covers the code. It does not cover text taken from
English Wikipedia, which is licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License (CC BY-SA 4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). This applies to:

- the data files in eval/ (questions, answers and evidence quotes written
  from Wikipedia sections), and
- the published search index (the Hugging Face dataset repo), whose chunks
  are Wikipedia text.

Each article's title, revision id and URL are kept with its text, so every
excerpt can be traced to its source page.
